Third-party fixtures
--------------------
tests/fixtures/html/postings.json contains project-authored, anonymized excerpts
based on the HTML structure of public ATS postings observed on 2026-10-03.
All posting prose in the fixture was written for this project. The excerpts are
licensed under this project's MIT License. No original posting prose is included.
The structural references were:
- Greenhouse public posting page:
  https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/greenhouse/jobs/8204473
- Lever public training posting page:
  https://jobs.lever.co/leverdemo-8/28b44fc8-5436-4110-aafa-cf83b6bff9c5
- Ashby public job-board description HTML:
  https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/ashby
The original pages and API output did not state a reuse license. They are not
redistributed here. Any recorded third-party posting added later needs its
source and license listed here.

tests/fixtures/lever/palantir_page.json is a byte for byte recording of three postings
from a public Lever postings feed, recorded on 2026-10-14:
https://api.lever.co/v0/postings/palantir?mode=json&limit=3
It is included as a hostile input sample for tests. The posting text belongs to its
publisher, and the feed did not state a reuse license.

tests/fixtures/ashby/ashby_board.json holds the first three jobs of a public Ashby job board
response, recorded on 2026-10-19:
https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/ashby
It is kept as recorded except that the list was cut to three jobs. It is included as a
hostile input sample for tests. The job text belongs to its publisher, and the feed did not
state a reuse license.

